),$ the general standard equation is given by\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}=4py\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is a constant.\n\nWe're told that the given parabola passes through the point $(-5,5),$ so we can substitute $x=-5$ and $y=5$ into the standard equation and solve for $p:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2} & =4py \\\\ (-5)^{2} & =4p(5) \\\\ 25 & =20p \\\\ p & =\\frac{5}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the parabola is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2} & =4py \\\\ {x}^{2} & =4(\\frac{5}{4})y \\\\ {x}^{2} & =5y.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266269 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266270 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266271 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266272 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266273 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1041 "selection" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266273 13194139533925 true] [17592186266268 1110 #uuid "7a71da3b-5265-5443-bc9f-9bdddee6a94e" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266269 1034 "{x}^{2}=-3y" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266269 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533925 true] [17592186266269 1111 #uuid "f0cf56ca-2f98-58c3-8a40-d8047062c61d" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266270 1034 "{x}^{2}=y" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266270 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533925 true] [17592186266270 1111 #uuid "e1fb6eab-a26e-5794-a3d0-b90227d6e6f3" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266271 1034 "{x}^{2}=-5y" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266271 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533925 true] [17592186266271 1111 #uuid "4394461f-da87-5470-9e98-7e1eb7b19c8c" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266272 1034 "{x}^{2}=3y" 13194139533925 true] [17592186266272 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533925 true] [17592186266272 1111 #uuid "693d6b56-8fb2-5bb3-b1f8-15fc4ec38686" 13194139533925 true] [1759218626627